# Knowledge — Quadratic

Educational content for quadratic equations is stored in MongoDB (`agentKnowledge`).

Seed/import files will be added in **Phase 7**. See `MODEL_INSTRUCTIONS.md` for document format.

Planned knowledge types:

- definition (standard form, discriminant, roots)
- formula (quadratic formula)
- explanation (beginner / intermediate / advanced)
- hint (per solving step)
- misconception (sign errors, coefficient confusion)
